window.products.push({"id":903564,"name":"Baxton Studio FP-6792-Espresso Shoe Storage Bench, 14.55LX43.91WX19.23H, Dark Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ViWJdN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The clean lines on this robust shoe storage cabinet mean that it'll effortlessly blend into any entryway and really help clear your space of those messy piles of shoes that everyone always trips over. Constructed of engineered wood in dark espresso PU veneer, the three doors reveal six cubbies that could at least fit 6 pairs of adults shoe and couple extra pairs of flip-flops or children shoes. To add practicality, the top of the bench is upholstered in dark brown faux leather as a cushion seat for seating while you put on your shoes. Sheffield shoe storage cabinet bench is ventilated through the louvered doors to stop those smelly shoe odors that can often build-up inside. For a modern look, silver hardware is added to ease every day's use. Made in Malaysia, the Sheffield requires assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ViWJdN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B09KP15Y2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-903564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KP15Y2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KP15Y2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
