window.products.push({"id":903631,"name":"Homemate Twin Size（39\"x10\"x6\"）Bed Wedge Pillow Stopper, Bed Gap Filler(0-8\"), Headboard Pillow, Triangle Bloster Pillow Wedge, Mattress Wedge Pillow t","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VscnlIJRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Perfect Bed Gap Filler】 Our triangle pillow measures 6\"*10\" and offers 4 length sizes of bed wedge mattress suitable for a wide range of bed sizes. This triangle wedge cushion can fill a gap from 0 to 8 inches, and can perfectly fill the gap between the headboard or wall and mattress to prevent pillows, toys, remote controls and other items from falling out of the bed. 【High-Density Foam】Homemate is committed to using quality materials to give you a better experience. Our bed wedge pillow using 25D high-density quality sponge, soft and hard enough to support, high resilience to ensure multiple use to maintain its original shape. Note: triangle bloster pillow is a compressed package, after a long period of transport, need to be placed 24-48 hours to restore the shape. 【Multi-Purpose Use】Our bed wedge pillow for headboard can not only be used as a bed gap filler, but also can be used with ordinary pillows to elevate your head and release the pressure on your shoulders and neck when sleeping on your side and back. You can also use it for sofa pillow filler, while it can be used as back support pillow. In addition our triangular pillow can also be used for arch support pillow, foot elevated pilow. 【Side Pocket Design】Our triangle bed wedge cushion pillowcase is made of high-quality breathable material, certified by Oktex and Certipur-US, and will not sweat with long-term use. Both sides of the headboard wedge pillowcase are designed with reinforced pockets, which can facilitate you to place your cell phone, remote control, glasses or other items at any time. 【Machine Washable & Considerate Service】Our foam wedge pillow for headboard features a high quality zipper that allows you to easily remove the pillowcase for machine washing. We are committed to providing a worry-free purchase service, offering you a return service and a 3-year warranty. If you have any questions with our bed crack pillow , please feel free to contact us, we will provide 24-hour around-the-clock attentive service. 【Tips】: Sponge products after a long time compression, the slow rebound memory foam will swell into its original shape within 24 to 72 hours, the smell will dissipate within 2 days, this is a normal phenomenon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VscnlIJRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeMate","source_asin":"B0BRQNFPF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-903631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRQNFPF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRQNFPF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
