window.products.push({"id":903656,"name":"Stone Bath Mat, Diatomaceous Earth Shower Mat Nonslip Super Absorbent Quick Drying Bathroom Floor Mat for Kitchen Counter, Natural Bathroom Mat Stone ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.53,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZXK4BQML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stunning Water Absorbency Stone Bath Mat 】BYPP natural Diatomite bath mat are made of diatoms as raw materials that holds exceptional absorbency and moisture-wicking properties that quickly evaporate water from the surface! Keep your feet or floor dry and clean, you can see the watermarks vanish within a minutes. Say goodbye to the wet and slippery floors. 【Anti-Slip and Safe Design】The shower bath mat surface has a striped texture to increase friction and plays a role in antiskid and abrasion resistant designed . It comes with a non-slip mat to achieve a double anti-slip effect when stepping out of the tub or shower.Make your bath or shower time safer and minimize the risk of slips or falls for kids and elderly. 【Easy Clean and Low Maintain】Our bath tub mat will last longer and dries instantly keep bathroom floors dry but no daily washing need compared to fabric bath mats.Just rinse with water or wipe with a damp cloth; stubborn stains can be sanded with sandpaper to clean and restored the absorbency . 【Natural and Reliable Design 】 Our eco-friendly natural bath mat is made from fossilized earth that naturally deodorizes and purifies the air. Unlike traditional bath mats that absorb moisture and generate bacteria, the quick drying bathroom floor mat is designed to eliminating moisture buildup and bad smells .And natural diatomaceous earth mineral softer than ceramic bathroom tiles ensures your bath mat stone won't ever scratch your floor. 【Perfect Water Absorbing Pad for All Around Your Home 】 The simple and elegant design of Diatomite bath mat stone matcompliment your bathroom’s aesthetics. It can also be used in the kitchen, by the tub, in front of the sink or by a personal pool. Hard stone bath tub mat can be placed in front of the door for wet shoes, wet umbrellas. The stone shower mat can also be used as a stone dish drying mat for countertop dishes or water bowl mat .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZXK4BQML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOFTER","source_asin":"B0BCNZ8JYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-903656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCNZ8JYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCNZ8JYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
