window.products.push({"id":903682,"name":"Hidden Assets Unique Pop-up 4 Cell Shoe Bin/Shoe Organizer - Perfect for Office, Locker, College Dorm Room, Travel Accessory, or Home (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811fdcZ472L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Protects and Organizes your Extra Pairs of Shoes.   Fits Discreetly under a Desk at work, in a Locker, Closet, or Car.  Colors: Black, Leopard, Python.  Lightweight, Portable, Dust and Water Resistant.  No Assembly Needed. Easy to open and close.  Great for the Office, College Dorm, Car, Travel, and Dressing Room.  Clear the Clutter – your manager, colleagues and clients don’t need to see what’s under your desk.   Stop kicking your shoes under your desk or throwing them in a drawer. Protect your precious assets.  Great gift idea.   3 Sizes :-  6 Cell: 17 inch x 12 inch x 12 inch, Weight: 9 oz.  4 Cell: 12 inch x 12 inch x 12 inch, Weight: 7 oz.  3 Cell: 17 inch x 8 inch x 10 inch Weight: 8 oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811fdcZ472L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hidden Assets","source_asin":"B01M1AZE0H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-903682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M1AZE0H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M1AZE0H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":903683,"name":"Villeroy & Boch Vieux Luxembourg Tea Cup, 7.5 oz, White/Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QGTyf3L8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Classic dining with old Luxembourg: hot tea is stylishly served in this charming cup with delicate decor and pattern. Together with the saucer it forms a beautiful duo. The cup can also be used for Coffee. In addition, it is easy to hold and, thanks to the high-quality porcelain, it is also suitable for use when catering. Amazon.com Delicately detailed and invitingly shaped, it's easy to see why Vieux Luxembourg is one of Villeroy & Boch's most enduring dinnerware patterns. This porcelain teacup holds 7-1/2 ounces in a wide, creamy white body with a slightly flared rim. Meticulously painted sprays of dark blue flowers grace the sides, backed by a subtly textured pattern in the glaze of long, wavy ridges. A matching navy line circles the top edge of the mug, while more flourishes decorate the slim, contoured handle. The final effect is both organic and refined, making a serving of energizing English Breakfast or fragrant Rooibos tea feel even cozier. Imported from Germany, this porcelain pattern was first introduced in 1768 and has withstood the test of time and fashion. Today's version is vitrified for durable everyday use and goes safely in the dishwasher and microwave. It also matches an extensive line of serving dishes, accessories, and bakeware--perfect for creating an elegantly coordinated home décor. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QGTyf3L8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B000BDHBHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-903683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BDHBHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000BDHBHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
