window.products.push({"id":903906,"name":"ChadMade Outdoor Curtain Custom Made ( 1 Panel ), Rose Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x3-Fqt2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ChadMade ROSE Collection Material: 100% Polyester.Weight: main fabric 240gsm.Fit for: Work for rod or pole in living room, bedroom, patio door, room divider.Feature: Solid, heavy and drapable.Colorways: 14 colors to select. MEASUREMENT Curtain is sold per panel, not pair. The panel width is the width with pleats already set in the panel. You decide how many panels to cover your window or patio door according to the fullness you need. We suggest fullness 1.0X-1.2X. For example, the overall width of traverse rod ( from end to end) or rail track is 104\", then you need to choose 2 panels of each 52\"-62\" ( for overlap) wide or 1 panel of 104\"-125\" wide ( could be customized).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x3-Fqt2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChadMade","source_asin":"B07XXVMN98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-903906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XXVMN98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XXVMN98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":903907,"name":"BEAUHAK Vinyl Tablecloth Rectangle, 54'' x 78'' Waterproof Spill Proof Oil Proof Stain Proof PVC Table Cloth, Wipe Clean Plastic Table Cover for Indoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cvvx-lX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUHAK floral tablecloth is made from premium environmentally PVC, the material allows wrinkled tablecloths to be quickly restored to flatness. Its good drapability, excellent strength and durability not only extend the life of outdoor table cloth, but also protect your table from scratches. Active dying technology, is used to effectively prevent fading and warping, and it looks like new when you use every time. The soft smooth surface can bring good comfort to your meal. RECOMMEND SIZE-- The picnic table cover available in 2 sizes: 54 x 78 inch, 54 x 108 inch. Please measure your table size before buying. (Pls note the tablecloth size ≠ table size). The floral patterns and textures of the tablecloths are matched together to create a comfortable dining environment for you and your family in a simple yet elegant way. FEATURE-- Our holiday table cloths have good waterproof, spill-proof, oil-proof, scratch-proof, stain resistant and dust-proof functions. All liquids will form beads on its surface, which effectively prevents liquids from infiltrating the table and protects the table from being wet and soiled. It is a good protective cover, which can better protect the table, prevent dents and scratches, extend the life of the table. Also won’t be easily removed, so you can enjoy your dinner with no worries. MULTIPLE PURPOSES-- The wipeable tablecloth is perfect for many occasions, such as kitchen, living room, dining room, restaurant, indoor, outdoor, party, wedding, banquet, picnic, camping, barbecue, is a unique and exquisite gift for birthday, Christmas, Valentine’s Day and Thanksgiving more. You can also cut it into various sizes for DTY and decorate your cabinets, coffee tables and bedside tables. EASY CARE-- Compared with traditional tablecloths, the heat resistant table covers are easier to clean and take care of. Just use a damp cloth, napkin, or sponge, don’t worry the water, oil, wine, coffee, beverage, juice falls on the tablecloth. Pls note: DO NOT MACHINE WASH, DO NOT BLEACH, DO NOT IRON, DO NOT USE THE DRYER.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cvvx-lX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEAUHAK","source_asin":"B094V56SBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-903907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094V56SBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094V56SBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
